{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星陳喬恩、內地女星林允、孔雪兒、內地男星張雲龍、鄧凱等昨晚（12日）以盛裝出席廈門舉行的2026年代言人影響力盛典，其中林允領獎時不慎在台上摔倒。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;林允身穿露肩的墨綠色閃片晚裝亮相，透視裙擺令</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.712255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_hash":"06b1e2e7cfcfc60bec2d94be71f26b2c4630faa826328d4f22b4714393b6c82d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}